Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/switch_not_exhaustive.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     val x = Light.Red;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0984]: `when` is no longer a keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/switch_not_exhaustive.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     when x {
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `if` is the one branching keyword — multi-arm dispatch is `if subject { arm -> body }`
 Fix: write `if subject { value -> body … }` (an `else -> body` catch-all)
